    "about.intro": "8M Voices is a collective storytelling project dedicated to amplifying the voices, experiences, and perspectives of women and allies around the world. Inspired by the global movement surrounding March 8 (International Women\u2019s Day), our project creates a space where stories can be shared, preserved, and heard across borders.",
    "about.marches": "Around the world, the 8M marches represent more than a single day of protest. They are moments of memory, resistance, solidarity, and hope. Each year, millions of people take to the streets to demand equality, dignity, safety, and justice. Behind every march, every sign, and every chant are personal stories\u2014stories that deserve to be seen and remembered.",
