    "sheets.title": "Sheets",
    "sheets.description": "La cobija de la impunidad is a performative and participatory intervention that invites us to look at what is normally hidden. A spread-out sheet symbolizes that \u201Ccobija\u201D (blanket) that covers and protects impunity. During the march, women and children were invited to write on sticky notes what they feel remains hidden underneath: fears, injustices, rage, pain, silences. These words\u2014the most repeated were fear, injustice, and rage\u2014were stuck onto the fabric, collectively revealing the emotional and social weight that impunity leaves in its wake. The piece seeks to encourage naming the unnameable, bringing to light what hurts, and transforming silence into visible presence. Under the blanket there is no void: there are voices, memories, and demands for justice.",
